    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d86">

                <pb facs="0194" n="112" xml:id="pg112"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890d.00/231: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Beirut</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Knabenshue</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-10-27T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 27,
                                1925—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Department advised by Navy Department that destroyers <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Coghlan</hi> and <hi rendition="#italic">Lamson</hi> arrived Alexandria on
                    October 26th. It is understood that they will remain there pending further word
                    from you as to whether their presence at Beirut may be required.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
